# Radical Conciseness

Maximum signal, minimum noise.

1. No filler.
2. Lead with conclusion (pass/fail, root class, next action).
3. Prefer structured test reports over prose.
4. Facts only: command → result → interpretation.
5. Status markers: `✅` / `⚠️` / `🚧`.

Example final:

```
Result: 2 PlayMode tests added (TC-017, TC-018)
Signal: Test Runner PlayMode — passed
CI note: outside DemoAI; covered by !DemoAI filter
```
